<title>USA: BW/IP names chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>BW/IP names chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>LONG BEACH, Calif. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>BW/IP Inc said Wednesday it has appointed Renee Hornbaker as chief financial officer. She succeeds Eugene Cross, who has retired.</p>
<p>Hornbaker has been with BW/IP for the past year. Before joining BW/IP she worked at Phelps Dodge Corp.</p>
